opt.display.mode.label=Window
opt.display.mode.desc=Borderless covers the whole screen.
opt.display.window_size.label=Window size
opt.display.window_size.desc=In windowed mode. The game draws 720p; the picture is scaled to the window.
opt.display.vsync.label=VSync
opt.display.vsync.desc=Wait for the display's refresh: no tearing.
opt.display.frame_cap.label=Frame rate cap
opt.display.frame_cap.desc=An even pace instead of the highest rate the PC reaches. With frame generation, off follows the monitor.
opt.display.show_fps.label=Frame rate display
opt.display.show_fps.desc=On screen shows FPS, frame time and the CPU, GPU, PPU, SPU and RSX load.
opt.display.ultrawide.label=Ultrawide
opt.display.ultrawide.desc=Draws the game to the full width of a wider screen. The HUD, menus and movies stay 16:9. Takes effect at the next start.
opt.display.shader_hint.label=Shader build indicator
opt.display.shader_hint.desc=A spinner in the bottom left corner while the game's new shaders are built, as RPCS3 shows.
opt.launcher.effects.label=Retro effects
opt.launcher.effects.desc=Scanlines and a neon glow in this window. The game is not changed.
